{"title":"Career roadmap — Healthcare Social Worker","role":"Healthcare Social Worker","summary":"A Healthcare Social Worker supports patients and families with the social, emotional, financial and practical challenges associated with illness, hospitalisation, rehabilitation and long-term care.","facts":{"Current degree":"BA (Bachelor of Arts – General / Honours)","Course":"Social Work (BSW)"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The role connects patients, families, doctors, nurses, counsellors, government schemes, insurance providers, NGOs and community resources. It is a non-clinical profession, but it plays an important role in patient-centred healthcare."}]},{"heading":"Career horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"Build social-work, counselling, case-management, healthcare-system and communication skills"}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Specialise in hospital social work, oncology, mental-health support, rehabilitation, palliative care or community health"}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Progress to Senior Medical Social Worker, Case Manager, Programme Manager or Patient-Support Lead"}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Lead hospital social-work teams, patient-support programmes, community-health programmes or healthcare social-impact initiatives"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to build each year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Social work & human behaviour foundations"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Introduction to social work"},{"text":"Sociology"},{"text":"Psychology"},{"text":"Human development"},{"text":"Social problems"},{"text":"Family and community systems"},{"text":"Communication"},{"text":"Ethics"},{"text":"Social justice"},{"text":"Basic counselling skills"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Develop:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Active listening"},{"text":"Empathy"},{"text":"Professional communication"},{"text":"Interviewing"},{"text":"Observation"},{"text":"Documentation"},{"text":"Conflict management"}]},{"type":"note","label":"Output","text":"Conduct a supervised community or patient-support needs assessment."},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — Healthcare social work"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Hospital social work"},{"text":"Healthcare systems"},{"text":"Patient rights"},{"text":"Medical terminology basics"},{"text":"Mental-health fundamentals"},{"text":"Disability and rehabilitation"},{"text":"Public-health concepts"},{"text":"Health insurance basics"},{"text":"Government healthcare schemes"},{"text":"Case management"},{"text":"Crisis intervention"},{"text":"Family counselling fundamentals"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand the patient journey:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Diagnosis","Treatment","Financial/social barriers","Family support","Discharge","Rehabilitation","Community follow-up"]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — Clinical environment & specialisation"},{"type":"p","text":"Build practical knowledge of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Psychosocial assessment"},{"text":"Case documentation"},{"text":"Discharge planning"},{"text":"Referral systems"},{"text":"Patient advocacy"},{"text":"Resource mobilisation"},{"text":"Community rehabilitation"},{"text":"Palliative-care support"},{"text":"Grief and bereavement support"},{"text":"Healthcare programme coordination"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Choose a specialisation:"},{"type":"table","header":["Specialisation","Potential focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"Oncology Social Work"},{"text":"Cancer patients and families"}],[{"text":"Palliative Care"},{"text":"End-of-life and family support"}],[{"text":"Rehabilitation"},{"text":"Disability and recovery"}],[{"text":"Mental Health"},{"text":"Psychosocial support"}],[{"text":"Child Healthcare"},{"text":"Paediatric patients"}],[{"text":"Geriatric Care"},{"text":"Elderly patients"}],[{"text":"Co